  ["&'a str: the output lives at least as long as the shorter of a and b. Lifetimes describe; they never extend anything."] = "&'a str：输出至少活得和 a、b 中较短的一样久。生命周期只是描述；从不延长任何东西。",
  ["&'static str lives for the whole program. String literals are 'static; a returned reference with no input to borrow from must be too."] = "&'static str 活满整个程序。字符串字面量是 'static；没有输入可借的返回引用也必须是。",
  ["&String is a shared borrow: read only, any number at once, the owner keeps the value."] = "&String 是共享借用：只读，可以同时有任意多个，所有者仍保有值。",
  ["&T{} is the usual way to make a pointer to a struct. p.Field works without (*p)."] = "&T{} 是创建 struct 指针的常用写法。p.Field 不用写 (*p)。",
  ["&dyn Cook is a trait object: a pointer plus a vtable. Go interfaces work the same way underneath."] = "&dyn Cook 是 trait 对象：一个指针加一个 vtable。Go 的 interface 底层也是这么干的。",
  ["&mut a. While r lives, no other borrow of a may exist: exactly 1 &mut, or many &, never both."] = "&mut a。r 活着的时候，a 不能有别的借用：要么恰好 1 个 &mut，要么多个 &，绝不同时。",
  ["&prices[1..3] is a slice of type &[i32]: a borrowed window, no copy. [1..] and [..2] also work."] = "&prices[1..3] 是类型为 &[i32] 的切片：借用的窗口，不复制。[1..] 和 [..2] 也行。",
  ["&str is a view into text; String owns it. Take &str in parameters, return String when you build new text. The receipt prints once."] = "&str 是文本的视图；String 拥有文本。参数收 &str，构造新文本时返回 String。收据只打印一次。",
  ["(ok, err). Check err before using ok. The gate opens."] = "(ok, err)。用 ok 之前先检查 err。闸机开了。",
