  ["A heap pointer to a dyn trait: Box, angle brackets, dyn, the trait."] = "指向 dyn trait 的堆指针：Box、尖括号、dyn、那个 trait。",
  ["A list is Option<Box<ListNode>>. take() moves a node out and leaves None. Reverse with prev and cur; slow and fast runners find the middle."] = "链表就是 Option<Box<ListNode>>。take() 把一个节点移出来，原地留下 None。用 prev 和 cur 反转；快慢指针找中点。",
  ["A loop that returns a value? Go cannot do that."] = "会返回值的循环？Go 可做不到。",
  ['A map from string to int. Fill the type: prices := ___{"muffin": 18}'] = '从 string 到 int 的 map。填入类型：prices := ___{"muffin": 18}',
  ["A map is a hash table. comma-ok tells you if the key was there. delete removes it."] = "map 是哈希表。comma-ok 告诉你键在不在。delete 删除它。",
  ["A map turns O(n^2) two-sum into O(n). Two pointers check a palindrome. A [26]int counts letters."] = "map 把 O(n^2) 的两数之和变成 O(n)。双指针判回文。[26]int 数字母。",
