  ["A recursive func needs a base case and a smaller call. A memo map turns fib from 2^n into n."] = "递归函数需要基准情形和更小的调用。一个 memo map 把 fib 从 2^n 变成 n。",
  ["A reference must not outlive what it points at. 'a names how long; 'static means the whole program."] = "引用不能活得比它指向的东西久。'a 给这段时长起名；'static 表示整个程序期间。",
