  ["Option<Box<ListNode>>: each node owns the next, the last one holds None. Same size as a raw pointer."] = "Option<Box<ListNode>>：每个节点拥有下一个，最后一个装着 None。大小和裸指针一样。",
  ["Option<T> is an enum in the standard library, generic like your own types. No null anywhere in Rust."] = "Option<T> 是标准库里的 enum，和你自己的类型一样是泛型的。Rust 里哪儿都没有 null。",
