  ["Order is a struct. Point at it. The till talks through an interface."] = "Order 是 struct。用指针指向它。收银机通过 interface 沟通。",
  ["Orders come through the web now. Put a handler on /order."] = "订单现在从网页来了。给 /order 挂一个 handler。",
  ["Owner says: ship before 18:00 and the dinner set is on the house."] = "老板说：18:00 前上线，晚餐套餐店里请。",
  ["Ownership and borrowing"] = "所有权与借用",
  ["PERFECT!"] = "完美！",
  ["PORT"] = "竖屏",
  ["Packages and imports"] = "包与导入",
  ["Palindrome: the chars read the same backwards. Which iterator method walks from the end?"] = "回文：字符倒着读也一样。哪个迭代器方法从末尾往回走？",
  ["Partial, then the word for ordering. Ord alone is too strict for f64."] = "Partial，然后是表示排序的词。光用 Ord 对 f64 来说太严。",
  ["Pause this thread for 300 ms. Which function?"] = "让这个线程暂停 300 毫秒。哪个函数？",
  ["Pay() can fail. Check the error. Close the drawer with defer."] = "Pay() 可能失败。检查错误。用 defer 关抽屉。",
  ["Percival Street"] = "波斯富街",
  ["Percival Street at dawn. Walk if the crossing is clear, else wait. Go has no while: a for with a condition is the while."] = "黎明的波斯富街。路口没车就走，否则等。Go 没有 while：带条件的 for 就是 while。",
  ["Percival Street tram stop"] = "波斯富街电车站",
  ["Pick a branch by value without a chain of ifs. Which keyword?"] = "按值选分支，不用一串 if。哪个关键字？",
  ["Pick the bigger of a and b in one line. Which keyword starts the expression?"] = "一行选出 a 和 b 中较大的。哪个关键字开头？",
  ["Plain integers: equal values are indistinguishable, so stability is wasted. The faster in-place sort with no allocation?"] = "纯整数：相等的值根本分不出来，稳定性就浪费了。那个更快、原地、不分配内存的排序是哪个？",
  ["Plural of the type a single Unicode scalar has in Rust."] = "Rust 里单个 Unicode 标量值的类型，复数形式。",
  ["Point the current node backwards. Fill: cur.Next = ___"] = "让当前节点指回前一个。填空：cur.Next = ___",
  ["Pointer receiver to mutate or for big structs; value receiver for small read-only types."] = "要修改或 struct 很大时用指针接收者；小的只读类型用值接收者。",
  ["Pointer to the same struct type, like the tree node."] = "指向同一 struct 类型的指针，和树节点一样。",
  ["Price list is a map. Hash brown: 8 dollars."] = "价目表是个 map。薯饼：8 块。",
  ["Print the struct with its field names. Which verb?"] = "连字段名一起打印 struct。哪个动词？",
  ["Print the values sorted: left subtree, node, right subtree. Fill the first call."] = "按序打印：左子树、节点、右子树。填第一个调用。",
  ["Print then ln. fmt.println with a small p does not exist outside fmt."] = "Print 加 ln。小写 p 的 fmt.println 在 fmt 之外不存在。",
  ["Problem five: search and sort. Binary search on a sorted slice with half-open bounds, then merge sort, the recursion every interviewer loves. And the one-liner from the library."] = "第五题：查找与排序。在有序 slice 上用半开区间做二分查找，然后是归并排序，面试官最爱的递归。还有标准库的一行代码。",
  ["Problem four: the order queue as a singly linked list. Reverse it in place with three pointers, then detect a cycle with two runners of different speed."] = "第四题：把订单队列做成单链表。用三个指针原地反转，再用快慢两个指针检测环。",
  ["Problem seven, the one they always ask: N workers pull jobs from a channel and push results. Get the close and the wait in the right order and the job is yours."] = "第七题，必考题：N 个 worker 从 channel 取任务并推送结果。close 和 wait 顺序对了，这份工作就是你的。",
  ["Problem six: the classics. Two numbers that add up to the set price, a palindrome check that handles CJK, and whether two dish names are anagrams."] = "第六题：经典题。两个数加起来等于套餐价，能处理中日韩文字的回文判断，以及两个菜名是否为变位词。",
  ["Problem three: walk the MTR graph. Breadth-first with a queue for shortest hops, depth-first with recursion for reachability. Both need a visited set."] = "第三题：遍历港铁图。用队列做广度优先求最少站数，用递归做深度优先判可达性。两者都需要已访问集合。",
  ["Problem two: a binary search tree of order numbers. Insert, walk in order, measure the height. In Go a tree is just a struct with two pointers and a nil at every leaf."] = "第二题：订单号的二叉搜索树。插入、中序遍历、量高度。在 Go 里树就是带两个指针的 struct，每片叶子都是 nil。",
  ["Pull a *RefundError out of the chain to read its fields. Fill: errors.___(err, &re)"] = "从链里取出一个 *RefundError 来读它的字段。填：errors.___(err, &re)",
  ["Pull a crate in from the terminal without editing the file by hand. Which subcommand?"] = "在终端里拉进一个 crate，不用手改文件。哪个子命令？",
  ["Q other quest"] = "Q 其他任务",
  ["Q: "] = "问：",
  ["QUEST %d"] = "任务 %d",
  ["Queue board is stuck at zero. Nobody can order until it counts."] = "排队看板卡在零。它不计数，谁也点不了餐。",
  ["Queue for wide, stack for deep. Same loop, different end of the Vec."] = "横着走用队列，往深走用栈。同一个循环，只是取 Vec 的另一头。",
  ["R then Lock. Writers still use Lock and Unlock."] = "R 然后 Lock。写者仍用 Lock 和 Unlock。",
  ["ROUND 1  -  the buzzer"] = "第 1 回合  -  抢答器",
  ["ROUND 2  -  the tree"] = "第 2 回合  -  树",
  ["ROUND 3  -  the map"] = "第 3 回合  -  地图",
  ["ROUND 4  -  the chain"] = "第 4 回合  -  链",
  ["ROUND 5  -  the shuffle"] = "第 5 回合  -  洗牌",
  ["ROUND 6  -  the classics"] = "第 6 回合  -  经典题",
  ["RWMutex: RLock for readers, Lock for the one writer. Use it when reads dominate."] = "RWMutex：读者用 RLock，唯一的写者用 Lock。读远多于写时用它。",
  ["Rc counts on one thread only. Which shared pointer may cross threads?"] = "Rc 只能在一个线程上计数。哪个共享指针可以跨线程？",
  ["Reached an empty spot: make the node here. Fill: if n == ___"] = "到了空位：在这里建节点。填空：if n == ___",
  ["Read JSON bytes into the struct. Fill: json.___(b, &order)"] = "把 JSON 字节读进 struct。填：json.___(b, &order)",
  ["Read the root value without moving the Box out of the Option. Which Option method borrows the inside?"] = "读根节点的值，又不把 Box 从 Option 里移出去。哪个 Option 方法借用里面的内容？",
  ["Real life: sort orders by price, cheapest first, equal prices keep their order. Which stable slice method takes a key closure?"] = "现实场景：按价格给订单排序，最便宜的在前，价格相同的保持原序。哪个稳定的切片方法接收一个取键的闭包？",
  ["Receipt holds a &'a str. What must the struct declare after its name?"] = "Receipt 持有一个 &'a str。struct 名字后面必须声明什么？",
  ["Receipt<'_> means some lifetime, I do not need to name it. Clearer than impl<'a> Display for Receipt<'a> when 'a is never used."] = "Receipt<'_> 意思是某个生命周期，我不需要给它起名。'a 用不上时，比 impl<'a> Display for Receipt<'a> 更清楚。",
  ["Receive until the channel is closed. Fill: for m := ___ ch"] = "一直接收直到 channel 关闭。填空：for m := ___ ch",
  ["Receiver is Send but not Sync: three cooks cannot read the rail at once. Arc shares it; what hands out turns?"] = "Receiver 是 Send 但不是 Sync：三个厨师不能同时读这条轨。Arc 负责共享；那谁来分配先后？",
  ["Recurse into the same side you assign to. Mirror of the else branch."] = "递归进哪边就赋值给哪边。和 else 分支对称。",
  ["Recursion and memoization"] = "递归与记忆化",
  ["Recursive types need a pointer. nil children mark the end."] = "递归类型需要指针。nil 子节点表示到头了。",
  ["Reduce with your own start value and closure. Which method?"] = "用自己的初始值和闭包做归约。哪个方法？",
  ["Reformat every file to the standard style before the commit. Which subcommand?"] = "提交前把每个文件重排成标准风格。哪个子命令？",
  ["Release the lock however the function exits. Fill: defer mu.___()"] = "无论函数怎么退出都释放锁。填空：defer mu.___()",
  ["Remove a key from a map. Which built-in?"] = "从 map 里删除一个键。哪个内置函数？",
  ["Repeat forever until break hands back a value. Which keyword?"] = "一直重复，直到 break 交回一个值。哪个关键字？",
  ["Repeat while a condition holds. Which keyword?"] = "条件成立时一直重复。哪个关键字？",
  ['Report a failed check and keep the test running. Fill: t.___("got %d", n)'] = '报告一次检查失败并让测试继续。填空：t.___("got %d", n)',
  ["Response + Writer. An interface, so no star. It is also an io.Writer."] = "Response 加 Writer。是 interface，所以没有星号。它也是一个 io.Writer。",
  ["ResponseWriter: headers, status, body. Write the status before the body."] = "ResponseWriter：header、状态码、body。先写状态码，再写 body。",
  ["Result and the ? operator"] = "Result 与 ? 运算符",
  ["Result<T, E> is either Ok(value) or Err(error). The compiler makes you check. The till lights up."] = "Result<T, E> 要么是 Ok(value) 要么是 Err(error)。编译器逼你检查。收银机亮了。",
  ["Return a plus b without the return keyword. What is the last line of the body?"] = "不用 return 关键字返回 a 加 b。函数体最后一行是什么？",
  ["Return an iterator without naming its long type. Which keyword in the return position?"] = "返回一个迭代器，却不写出它冗长的类型。返回位置上用哪个关键字？",
  ["Return the cached answer if it is there. Fill the comma-ok test: if v, ok := memo[n]; ___"] = "缓存里有答案就直接返回。填 comma-ok 判断：if v, ok := memo[n]; ___",
  ["Returns a channel that fires once, later. Capital A."] = "返回一个稍后触发一次的 channel。大写 A。",
  ["Reverse with prev/cur/next pointers. Floyd's cycle check: slow moves one, fast moves two."] = "用 prev/cur/next 指针反转。Floyd 判环：slow 走一步，fast 走两步。",
  ["Reverse: point the current node backwards. Fill: node.next = ___"] = "反转：让当前节点往回指。填空：node.next = ___",
  ["Round five: the shuffle. Write merge sort by hand, then show me you know the std sorts. O(n log n) or bust!"] = "第五回合：洗牌。手写归并排序，然后让我看看你懂不懂 std 的排序。要么 O(n log n)，要么出局！",
  ["Round four: reverse the chain, then find its middle. The borrow checker is watching."] = "第四回合：反转这条链，再找出它的中点。借用检查器看着呢。",
  ["Round six. Fast hands, Mei. The crab on the kiosk is keeping time."] = "第六回合。手要快，Mei。自助机上那只螃蟹在计时。",
  ["Round three: the MTR map as a graph. Breadth first, then depth first. Do not visit a station twice!"] = "第三回合：把港铁线路图当成图。先广度优先，再深度优先。同一个站别走两次！",
  ["Run close() when this function returns, even on error. Which keyword?"] = "函数返回时执行 close()，出错也要执行。哪个关键字？",
  ["Run cross(), then test its error in the same if. Fill the operator: err ___ nil"] = "运行 cross()，再在同一个 if 里检查它的错误。填入运算符：err ___ nil",
  ["Run every function marked with the #[...] attribute for checks. Which subcommand?"] = "运行每个标了 #[...] 检查属性的函数。哪个子命令？",
  ["Run the cooks, stop on the first error, wait for all. Fill: g.___()"] = "启动厨师们，遇到第一个错误就停，等所有人完成。填空：g.___()",
  ["Rune, Count, In, String: one long name. Or len([]rune(s))."] = "Rune、Count、In、String：连成一个长名字。或者用 len([]rune(s))。",
  ["Russell Street"] = "罗素街",
  ["Rust ignores the rest of a line after which two characters?"] = "Rust 会忽略哪两个字符之后的整行内容？",
  ["Rust? I only know Go. Is it far?"] = "Rust？我只会 Go。远不远？",
  ["RwLock: many .read() guards at once, or one .write(). Use it when reads far outnumber writes; Mutex is simpler otherwise."] = "RwLock：同时多个 .read() 守卫，或者一个 .write()。读远多于写时用它；否则 Mutex 更简单。",
  ["S for string, then printf. Fprintf writes to a writer, Printf to stdout."] = "S 代表 string，后接 printf。Fprintf 写到 writer，Printf 写到 stdout。",
  ["STOP"] = "停止",
  ["STREAK x%d"] = "连胜 x%d",
  ["Same &mut memo goes into both calls, one after the other. The borrow checker is happy: they do not overlap."] = "同一个 &mut memo 一前一后进了两次调用。借用检查器很满意：它们不重叠。",
  ["Same built-in as for slices. A literal map[string]int{} also works."] = "和 slice 用同一个内置函数。字面量 map[string]int{} 也行。",
  ["Same keyword as for slices. No index; just the value."] = "和遍历 slice 用的关键字一样。没有索引，只有值。",
  ["Same name as Go's entry function, but it needs no package line."] = "和 Go 的入口函数同名，但不需要 package 那一行。",
  ["Same name as on HashMap, but on a set it returns bool. No contains check needed first."] = "和 HashMap 上同名，但在 set 上它返回 bool。不用先 contains 一次。",
  ["Same name as strings.Contains. Index returns the position or -1."] = "和 strings.Contains 同名。Index 返回位置，找不到返回 -1。",
  ["Same name as the Display helper on any value. to_string_pretty adds newlines."] = "和任何值上那个 Display 辅助方法同名。to_string_pretty 会加换行。",
  ["Same name as the derived trait, in lowercase."] = "和派生的 trait 同名，小写。",
  ["Same six letters as Go. Use it for early exits, not for the last line."] = "和 Go 一样的六个字母。用来提前退出，不用在最后一行。",
  ["Same verb as go run. cargo build only compiles."] = "和 go run 同一个动词。cargo build 只编译。",
  ["Same word as WaitGroup's. It returns the first non-nil error."] = "和 WaitGroup 的那个词一样。它返回第一个非 nil 的 error。",
  ["Same word as a single import, then parentheses."] = "和单个 import 用同一个词，后面加括号。",
  ["Same word as in switch. Turns select into a poll."] = "和 switch 里的词一样。把 select 变成轮询。",
  ["Satisfied implicitly: any type with those methods implements it."] = "隐式满足：任何拥有这些方法的类型都实现了它。",
  ["Save next, flip the link, advance both. prev is the new head when the loop ends."] = "保存 next，翻转链接，两者前进。循环结束时 prev 就是新头。",
  ["Schedules a call for later. Last in, first out. After the return happens."] = "把调用安排到之后执行。后进先出。在 return 之后运行。",
  ["Send a value into the channel. Fill the operator: ch ___ muffin"] = "向 channel 发送一个值。填运算符：ch ___ muffin",
  ["Send the jobs, then tell the workers there are no more. Which built-in?"] = "发完 jobs，再告诉 worker 没有更多了。哪个内置函数？",
  ["Send: safe to move to another thread. Sync: safe to share by &T. Rc has neither, Arc<T> has both when T does. The count is right. Milk tea and a pineapple bun: the afternoon tea set is yours."] = "Send：可以安全地移到另一个线程。Sync：可以安全地通过 &T 共享。Rc 两者都没有，T 有时 Arc<T> 两者都有。计数对了。奶茶加菠萝包：下午茶套餐是你的了。",
  ["Sender is Clone, Receiver is not: that is the mp and the sc in mpsc. Both tills feed one kitchen."] = "Sender 是 Clone，Receiver 不是：这就是 mpsc 里的 mp 和 sc。两台收银机喂同一个厨房。",
  ['Serve /order with the function serve. Fill: http.___("/order", serve)'] = '用函数 serve 处理 /order。填：http.___("/order", serve)',
  ["Seven letters, the unbounded one. sync_channel(n) would take a capacity."] = "七个字母，无界的那个。sync_channel(n) 则要传一个容量。",
  ["Seven letters. Does the value ... this pattern? Same verb, plural form."] = "七个字母。这个值是否 ... 这个模式？同一个动词，第三人称单数形式。",
  ["Seven letters. For humans; Debug is for {:?}."] = "七个字母。给人看的；Debug 是给 {:?} 的。",
  ["Seven letters. Gather everything into a container: Vec, String, HashMap, even Result."] = "七个字母。把所有东西收进一个容器：Vec、String、HashMap，甚至 Result。",
  ["Seven letters. Go spelled it chan."] = "七个字母。Go 拼成 chan。",
  ["Seven letters. The opposite of a debug build. The binary lands in target/ under that name."] = "七个字母。debug 构建的反面。二进制文件落在 target/ 下同名的目录里。",
  ["Shared and mutable across threads: wrap it, then lock it."] = "跨线程共享又可变：先包起来，再加锁。",
  ["Shipped. One more: the code still sorts by hand."] = "发布了。还有一件：代码还在手写排序。",
  ["Short declaration. Fill the operator: floor ___ 8"] = "短变量声明。填入运算符：floor ___ 8",
  ["Short for format. Println lives there."] = "format 的缩写。Println 就在里面。",
  ["Short for function. Then the name, then arguments in parentheses."] = "function 的缩写。然后是名字，再是括号里的参数。",
  ["Shout the shop name. Which strings function upper-cases?"] = "大声喊出店名。strings 的哪个函数转大写？",
  ["Signed, 32 bits, the default integer type. Write the annotation."] = "有符号，32 位，默认的整数类型。写出类型标注。",
  ["Siu Ming"] = "小明",
  ["Six letters, capital O. Rust's answer to nil: the type itself says maybe."] = "六个字母，大写 O。Rust 对 nil 的回答：类型本身就写着「也许」。",
  ["Six letters, same word as Go, but there is no type keyword in front."] = "六个字母，和 Go 同一个词，但前面没有 type 关键字。",
  ["Six letters, under sync/. Go 1.19 also has atomic.Int64 with .Add(1)."] = "六个字母，在 sync/ 下。Go 1.19 还有 atomic.Int64，用 .Add(1)。",
  ["Six letters. Every result, in order, comma separated."] = "六个字母。所有结果按顺序，用逗号分隔。",
  ["Six letters. Generic over T: Some(T) or None."] = "六个字母。对 T 泛型：Some(T) 或 None。",
  ["Six letters. Give the field a different name on the wire. rename_all does a whole struct."] = "六个字母。给字段在传输时换个名字。rename_all 对整个 struct 生效。",
  ["Six letters. Like a coffee one: only what passes the test comes through."] = "六个字母。像咖啡用的那个：只有通过测试的才能过。",
  ["Six letters. The closure gets &char and returns bool; true keeps the item."] = "六个字母。闭包拿到 &char 并返回 bool；true 就保留这个元素。",
  ["Six letters. The compiler writes the trait implementation for you."] = "六个字母。编译器替你写 trait 实现。",
  ["Six letters. The word in fmt spelled out. Variables can go straight inside the braces."] = "六个字母。fmt 的完整拼写。变量可以直接写进花括号里。",
  ["Six letters. To obtain from a source."] = "六个字母。从来源推导出来。",
  ["Six letters. Two arms: Ok(T) and Err(E)."] = "六个字母。两个分支：Ok(T) 和 Err(E)。",
  ["Six letters. What you do when you are sure it is there."] = "六个字母。你确定它在那里时做的事。",
  ["Six riders wait on the kerb because the backend asks the map API one address at a time."] = "六个骑手在路边等着，因为后端一次只向地图 API 问一个地址。",
  ["Six tickets sent. Now end the cooks' loops: recv must return Err. What do you do with tx?"] = "六张单发出去了。现在结束厨师们的循环：recv 必须返回 Err。你要对 tx 做什么？",
  ["Skip a closed shop and go on to the next one. Which keyword?"] = "跳过关门的店，继续下一家。哪个关键字？",
  ["Slices alias. Use copy() or append([]int(nil), a...) when you need your own."] = "slice 会别名共享。需要自己的一份时用 copy() 或 append([]int(nil), a...)。",
  ["Smaller goes left, bigger goes right. Draw it before you type it."] = "小的往左，大的往右。先画图再敲代码。",
  ["Smaller goes left, bigger goes right. In Rust a leaf is None and a child is a Box."] = "小的往左，大的往右。在 Rust 里，叶子是 None，子节点是一个 Box。",
  ["Smaller values go down one side. Fill the arm: if v < n.val => insert(&mut n.___, v)"] = "更小的值往一边走。填这条分支：if v < n.val => insert(&mut n.___, v)",
  ["Smaller values go left. Fill: n.Left = insert(n.___, v)"] = "小的值往左。填空：n.Left = insert(n.___, v)",
  ["Sogo"] = "崇光",
  ["Sogo's directory is a map from shop name to floor. Missing keys return the zero value, so you must ask comma-ok before you trust the number."] = "崇光的楼层索引是从店名到楼层的 map。不存在的键返回零值，所以相信那个数字之前必须先问 comma-ok。",
  ["Some or None. Rust has no null, so the possibly-empty next is spelled out in the type."] = "Some 或者 None。Rust 没有 null，所以可能为空这件事直接写在类型里。",
  ["Sort the names in place. Fill: slices.___(names)"] = "原地排序 names。填：slices.___(names)",
  ["Sorted prices. Find 25 in log n. Then sort the unsorted ones in n log n."] = "有序的价格。用 log n 找到 25。再用 n log n 排好乱序的。",
  ["Sorting and searching"] = "排序与查找",
  ["Sounds like request, spelled with a w. Built on hyper and tokio."] = "读起来像 request，拼写里带个 w。建在 hyper 和 tokio 之上。",
